# Provide reproducible tests

## Requirement

Provide a minimal reproducible test suite for the first VS Code implementation.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Initial delivery scope / Visual Studio Code

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
